        "official_en_sha256": "29e063d36e47676c5bc3ef428093fe92251dad42eeaf7610f6b9cab85bcc2e55"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ああ。\r\n母上はすでに引退した騎士だからな。\r\nレインとラスウェルが存在を知らなくても無理はない。",
        "official_en": "Yes. She has already retired from the Order, so it’s not surprising you two don’t know of her.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
